postgres-db                | 	Based on the provided text, the following information is available for IBM Cloud:
postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	**Incident Information**
postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	* Incident Name: Power Grid Utility Outage
postgres-db                | 	* Affected Services: VPC, SQL Query, Load Balancer, Network Infrastructure, Watson Platform, and VSIs
postgres-db                | 	* Regions/Availability Zones: Frankfurt (FRA05) Data Center and eu-de zone 3 (EU-DE-3)
postgres-db                | 	* Cloud Provider: IBM Cloud
postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	**Sequence of Events**
postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	1. 20 June 2023 03:20 - Power grid utility outage occurred.
postgres-db                | 	2. 20 June 2023 03:46 - UPS batteries depleted and FRA05 server room 2 lost power.
postgres-db                | 	3. 20 June 2023 03:49 - Incident Started
postgres-db                | 	4. 20 June 2023 04:12 - IBM Cloud Site Operator Engineering team began data center recovery actions.
postgres-db                | 	5. 20 June 2023 04:17 - Power was restored on the affected rack.
postgres-db                | 	6. 20 June 2023 04:30 - All bare metal hosts were back online.
postgres-db                | 	7. 20 June 2023 05:00 - Facilities grid power supply was restored and transition from generator to utility was completed.
postgres-db                | 	8. 20 June 2023 05:41 - IBM Cloud Site Operator Engineering team were notified that power was restored after inspection.
postgres-db                | 	9. 20 June 2023 10:33 - VPC underlying host operating system was restored.
postgres-db                | 	10. 20 June 2023 12:18 - All VSI Hosts were recovered.
postgres-db                | 	11. 20 June 2023 19:14 - VPC SDN was restored.
postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	**Root Cause**
postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	The root cause of the outage is not explicitly stated in the text, but it appears to be related to a power grid utility outage that affected the FRA05 server room and caused a series of events leading to the incident.
