postgres-db                | 	
postgres-db                | 	 Region/Availability Zone: Northern Virginia (US-EAST-1)
postgres-db                | 	 Impact Date: November 25th, 2020, at 2:44 AM PST
postgres-db                | 	 Duration: Approximately 5 hours and 47 minutes
postgres-db                | 	 Root Cause: A relatively small addition of capacity that began to be added to the service
postgres-db                | 	 Downtime Period: The outage started at 2:44 AM PST and ended at 8:31 AM PST
