postgres-db                | 	 Duration: Approximately 4 hours and 21 minutes
postgres-db                | 	 Root Cause: Memory contention on the underlying service hosts used for Lambda function invocations
postgres-db                | 	 Downtime Period: The outage started at 6:15 AM PST and ended at 10:36 AM PST
